=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find items to solve puzzles and progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defend yourself with both melee and ranged weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage scavenged resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beware of the many traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple main paths of play and endings!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be played in both fixed camera or over-the-shoulder third person</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339330/extras/567f1eb59e8f63d2a2cd1d9955284624.poster.avif?t=1772040211\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339330/extras/567f1eb59e8f63d2a2cd1d9955284624.webm?t=1772040211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339330/extras/567f1eb59e8f63d2a2cd1d9955284624.mp4?t=1772040211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Save the Girl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2339330/5aaf9a30a4b9d823e21c579ac02f6c419544f23b.jpg"},{"name":"Bros Before Not Bros","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2339330/a5cc84209165e807614468559fdd4ce21b0de070.jpg"},{"name":"You live like this?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2339330/de0a6aab8e6a42beb10fe9e8fedfd0a465b805f1.jpg"},{"name":"Going Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2339330/15ccb9ba4ad5d4cb5ec075752cd0dab972ef7c97.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Hot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2339330/7ceae019bc3288c142fa4708f70db